    "    \"    \\\"- 🔧 **Preprocessing**: 6-step imputation strategy - numeric + categorical + datetime (preprocessing/imputation.py)\\\\n\\\",\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    \\\"- 📈 **EDA**: Statistical tests, benchmarking (advanced_eda.py, benchmarking.py, eval.py)\\\\n\\\",\\n\",\n",
